*
!.gitignore

# Seed source imagery, copied from the reference app. These are the originals
# the catalog seeders attach to products and categories, so they are committed —
# `migrate:fresh --seed` needs them to build the demo store on a fresh clone.
!products/
!products/*
!categories/
!categories/*

# Everything else here is Media Library output: numbered per-media directories
# holding its own copy of the original plus the generated conversions
# (thumb, card, zoom, webp, lqip). All of it is derived and rebuilt by
# re-seeding and `php artisan media-library:regenerate`, so none of it is tracked.
